{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1772650907,"nonce":"HvQWi3SCj06EJ2SbZaDgscUTL2s=","title":"npm ci in worktrees corrupts main node_modules","message":"npm ci deletes node_modules before reinstalling. If run in a worktree that shares or symlinks node_modules from main, it destroys the main install. Mandible has crashed on restart twice from this.\n\nPrevention: never run npm ci in mandible worktrees — copy node_modules from main first.\n\n**Correct build procedure in worktrees:**\n```\ncp -r \u003cmain-worktree\u003e/node_modules \u003cfeature-worktree\u003e/node_modules\ncd \u003cfeature-worktree\u003e\nnpm run build\n```\n\nMigrated from dotfiles issue 566c3c2.","files":null}]}